<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>전체 국회의원 - 데이터정치</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/main.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/politician/politician.css">
    
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <div class="logo">
                <a href="/">데이터정치</a>
            </div>
            <nav>
                <ul>
                    <li><a href="/politician" class="active">국회의원</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#">의정활동</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#">데이터 랭킹</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#">사이트 소개</a></li>
                </ul>
            </nav>
            <div class="search-icon">
                <i class="fas fa-search"></i>
            </div>
        </header>

        <main>
            <section class="controls">
                <div class="politician-count" id="politician-count"></div>
                <div class="search-container">
                    <i class="fas fa-search"></i>
                    <input type="text" id="name-search" placeholder="이름으로 검색...">
                </div>
                <div class="sort-buttons">
                    <button class="sort-btn active" data-sort="name">이름순 <span class="sort-indicator"></span></button>
                    <button class="sort-btn" data-sort="party">정당순 <span class="sort-indicator"></span></button>
                    <button class="sort-btn" data-sort="reele">재선순 <span class="sort-indicator"></span></button>
                    <button class="sort-btn" data-sort="age">나이순 <span class="sort-indicator"></span></button>
                </div>                                
            </section>
            <section class="summary-section" id="politician-summary">
            </section>        
            <section class="politician-grid">
                <p class="loading-message">의원 목록을 불러오는 중입니다...</p>
            </section>
        </main>
        
        <footer>
             <div class="footer-links">
                <a href="#">사이트 소개</a>
                <a href="#">이용약관</a>
                <a href="#">개인정보처리방침</a>
                <a href="#">데이터 출처</a>
            </div>
            <div class="copyright">
                &copy; 2025 데이터정치. All rights reserved.
            </div>
        </footer>
    </div>

    <script src="/scripts/politician/politician.js"></script>
</body>
</html>